WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.745
A tile that never repeats.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.573
In two dimensions, every tile can repeat. Greenfeld

3
00:00:05.573 --> 00:00:07.999
and Tao broke this in huge dimension.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.176
A puzzle with no repeating solution is

5
00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:13.213
turned into one three dimensional tile.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.658
Claimed: it already fails in three dimensions.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.916
Main theorem in Lean.
